   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 06 00}{09 01 00}{07 02 00}No!{01 00 00 05 00} I didn't say cry! {01 00 00 0f 00}{07 06 00}I said\nsmile! Like this! {07 0d 00}{01 00 00 14 00}See? I'm\nsparkling! Now you try!",
